{
    "title": "Sporcle",
    "description": "Looking for a fun and challenging trivia experience? Look no further than Sporcle - the world\u2019s leading source of free trivia games and quizzes. With over 1 million quizzes available on all topics imaginable, you\u2019ll never run out of ways to test your knowledge.\r\n\r\nSporcle is home to the largest trivia library on the planet, with quizzes played over 5 billion times. Whether you\u2019re into sports, movies, geography, music, or something else entirely, you\u2019re sure to find a quiz that suits your interests.\r\n\r\nSome of the app\u2019s top features include:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Hundreds of categories to choose from\r\n\u2022 Multiple quiz formats, including maps, multiple choice, crosswords, clickable, fill in the blank, and more\r\n\u2022 Badges and achievements to earn by playing quizzes\r\n\u2022 The ability to play solo, against friends, or in real-time against players from around the world\r\n\u2022 A range of difficulty levels, from easy trivia to challenging questions that will put your knowledge to the test\r\n\u2022 Quiz playlists, forums, quests, and more to keep you entertained for hours on end\r\n\r\nBest of all, Sporcle is completely free to play, join, and create your own quizzes. \r\n\r\nAbout Sporcle Orange:\r\n\r\nIf you want an ad-free experience and access to advanced stats, upgraded search options, and special features, consider upgrading to Sporcle Orange - the app's premium subscription service. You can subscribe directly in the app, either monthly or yearly at a reduced rate. New features and experiences are added all the time!\r\n\r\nMORE APPS FROM SPORCLE\r\n\r\n\u2022 Sporcle Party\r\n\u2022 Word Ladder\r\n\r\nJOIN THE FUN\r\n\r\n\u2022 Website: https://www.sporcle.com\r\n\u2022 Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Sporcle\r\n\u2022 Twitter: https://twitter.com/sporcle\r\n\u2022 YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/sporcle\r\n\u2022 TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@sporcle.com\r\n\u2022 Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/sporclehq/\r\n\u2022 Blog: https://www.sporcle.com/blog/\r\n\r\nRead more about our terms and conditions here:\r\nTerms of service: https://www.sporcle.com/terms/\r\nPrivacy policy: https://www.sporcle.com/privacy/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking for a fun and challenging trivia experience? Look no further than Sporcle - the world\u2019s leading source of free trivia games and quizzes. With over 1 million quizzes available on all topics imaginable, you\u2019ll never run out of ways to test your knowledge.<br><br>Sporcle is home to the largest trivia library on the planet, with quizzes played over 5 billion times. Whether you\u2019re into sports, movies, geography, music, or something else entirely, you\u2019re sure to find a quiz that suits your interests.<br><br>Some of the app\u2019s top features include:<br><br>\u2022 Hundreds of categories to choose from<br>\u2022 Multiple quiz formats, including maps, multiple choice, crosswords, clickable, fill in the blank, and more<br>\u2022 Badges and achievements to earn by playing quizzes<br>\u2022 The ability to play solo, against friends, or in real-time against players from around the world<br>\u2022 A range of difficulty levels, from easy trivia to challenging questions that will put your knowledge to the test<br>\u2022 Quiz playlists, forums, quests, and more to keep you entertained for hours on end<br><br>Best of all, Sporcle is completely free to play, join, and create your own quizzes. <br><br>About Sporcle Orange:<br><br>If you want an ad-free experience and access to advanced stats, upgraded search options, and special features, consider upgrading to Sporcle Orange - the app&#39;s premium subscription service. You can subscribe directly in the app, either monthly or yearly at a reduced rate. New features and experiences are added all the time!<br><br>MORE APPS FROM SPORCLE<br><br>\u2022 Sporcle Party<br>\u2022 Word Ladder<br><br>JOIN THE FUN<br><br>\u2022 Website: https://www.sporcle.com<br>\u2022 Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Sporcle<br>\u2022 Twitter: https://twitter.com/sporcle<br>\u2022 YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/sporcle<br>\u2022 TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@sporcle.com<br>\u2022 Instagram: https://www